  <section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Upcoming calendar</span><h2>Nothing announced yet.</h2><p>There are no public events on the calendar at this time. Check back for confirmed dates, or contact us to share your interest.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact Sage & Spur</a></div><aside class="note"><strong>Before an event is published, we’ll confirm:</strong><ul><li>Date, time, and location</li><li>Who may attend and accessibility details</li><li>Costs, RSVP steps, and cancellation policy</li></ul></aside></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
